  "description": "Luna, the hidden daughter of Count Deheim, was born with the ancient runic letter symbolizing 'sin' carved into her body. When her family falls due to her father's rebellion, Luna is sold into slavery and abandoned as a sacrifice in a deep forest. \n\nReady to let go of her life and face death, she is fatefully rescued by Kadan, a blunt woodsman with a clumsy way of speaking. Treating her not as a 'cursed one' but simply as a 'human being,' Kadan wins Luna's heart, and the two build a special bond in his cabin. \n\nSoon, their feelings for one another blossom into physical desire as well.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14947876)",
